---
source: crates/holst-cli/src/table.rs
expression: help_of(line)
---
List what holst keeps on this machine, with sizes.
It only reads; nothing is removed.

USAGE
  holst storage ls

INHERITED FLAGS
  --output, --verbose, --base-url, --home, --no-cache, --help   as in `holst -h`

EXAMPLES
  $ holst storage ls
  $ holst storage ls -o json

LEARN MORE
  Exit codes: `holst help exit-codes`.
